# The recipe viewer layout of each recipe map in RecipeMaps, as <map> <width>x<height>, then each slot, tank,
# progress bar and image in the order it is drawn, with the textures drawn for it. Recorded from the screens of the
# old GUI system before recipe maps moved to ModularUI 2; RecipeMapCategoryLayoutTest compares the layouts with it.
# A deliberate layout change updates this listing; the test writes the layouts it found under build/layouts.
